  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Conceptualizing Streamflux Application**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the foundational elements for the \"Streamflux\" application. I\'m exploring architectural choices to guarantee high performance and responsiveness, starting with dark mode implementation and simulated real-time push notifications. Design adherence, and Electric Cinema themes are also primary considerations. I\'m thinking about the primary technology stacks for optimal results.\n\n\n**Defining Feature Integration**\n\nI\'m now integrating the core features for \"Streamflux,\" focusing on a robust search system and intuitive navigation. Cast details and playback views are being outlined. \"My List\" functionality, download management, and subscription options are prioritized, alongside dark/light theme choices and image handling. The architecture supports dynamic image loading for UI elements.\n\n\n**Outlining Search Functionality**\n\nI\'m currently focused on refining the search view\'s architecture. I\'m prioritizing quick action buttons like \"My List\" and download functionalities with progress indicators. \"More Like This\" Bento grid design with poster cards is also being outlined. The video player will feature playback controls, a timeline, and quality settings. I\'m focusing on an instant filter search bar with popular searches and browse categories.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 4
      nanos: 446514179
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
