  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing UI Components**\n\nI\'m now focused on building the UI components, starting with a clean split in `/src/components`. I\'m creating `Header.tsx`, which will contain the top navigation. This includes the STREAMFLUX logo, a search bar, view switching, a notification bell, a theme mode switch, and the user profile. I\'m aiming for a good, easy to understand architecture.\n\n\n**Defining New UI Elements**\n\nNow, I\'m working to expand the UI component suite. I\'ve got `BottomNav.tsx` in progress for the mobile bottom navigation, complete with glowing active tab indicators. The `HeroBanner.tsx` is next; I\'m building that featured section. I will then work on `MovieCard.tsx`, followed by `MovieDetailsView.tsx` and the `SearchScreen.tsx`, and finally, the `ProfileScreen.tsx`.\n\n\n**Expanding User Profile**\n\nI\'m now expanding the user profile component. It will now include the Alex Rivers portrait, Pro Member badge, bento stats for viewing, a continue watching scroller with progress bars, and a menu list. The menu will include common options and modal controls for settings editing. I\'ve also begun to implement the SubscriptionsScreen and VideoPlayerModal. I\'m also now planning for Notifications, including a drawer and toast.\n\n\n"
