  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Verifying Project Requirements**\n\nOkay, the compilation went smoothly, which is great. Now I\'m meticulously cross-referencing the project requirements. I am breaking down the user\'s specific requests. I\'m focusing on the screens and the app\'s overall structure to ensure I fully understand the scope.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have designed and implemented **StreamFlux**, a cinematic streaming web application matching the provided design specs and reference screens.\n\n### Key Highlights & Features\n\n- **Dark & Light Mode Integration**:\n  - Implemented the **Electric Cinema** dark theme by default (Deep Charcoal `#0b1326`, Electric Purple `#d0bcff`, Neon Pink `#ffb0cd`, and Cyber Lime `#ceee93`).\n  - Added a global theme switcher in the header and settings allowing instant switching between Dark and Light modes across every view.\n\n- **Cinematic Movie Details View**:\n  - Full movie details layout for **NEON HORIZON** (and all movie catalog items) featuring glassmorphic back & share buttons.\n  - High-res movie backdrop hero with Play CTA, rating (PG-13, 4.8 \342\230\205), runtime, release year, and genre pills.\n  - Expandable **Synopsis** section (\"Read more\" toggle).\n  - **Top Cast** horizontal scroller with character headshots, actor names, and roles (Kaelen Vance, Elena Rostova, Marcus Cole, Sarah Lin).\n  - Bento action controls (`+ My List`, `Download` with live progress feedback) and a **\"More Like This\"** movie poster grid.\n\n- **Real-Time Push Notification Engine**:\n  - Notification Bell icon with active unread badge counter in the top bar.\n  - Slide-in **Toast Notifications** for immediate user feedback when releases drop, downloads complete, or continue watching reminders trigger.\n  - Dropdown **Notification Drawer** with \"Mark as Read\", \"Clear All\", and a **Test Push Notification** button.\n\n- **Robust Search & Category Discovery**:\n  - Interactive search bar with real-time text matching against movie titles, genres, and synopsis descriptions.\n  - **Popular Searches** horizontal scroller with quality badges (4K, NEW, HD).\n  - **Browse Categories** bento grid (Action, Sci-Fi, Comedy, Horror, Drama, Anime) that filters catalog items instantly.\n\n- **Profile & Account Dashboard**:\n  - Profile header for **Alex Rivers** with a glowing avatar ring and **Pro Member** badge.\n  - Stats bento grid displaying **342 Hours Watched** and **47 Titles in List**.\n  - **Continue Watching** horizontal scroller with progress bars (*Neon Dreamscape*, *Void Walkers*, *Mecha Core*).\n  - Interactive modals for saved items in **My List**, offline **Downloads** management, account settings, and **Subscriptions Plan** upgrades.\n\n- **Interactive Video Player Modal**:\n  - Fullscreen streaming player with play/pause, scrub bar, quality selection (4K HDR, 1080p, 720p), subtitle selection, playback speed controls (1.0x to 2.0x), and volume control."
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 274809171
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
steps {
  type: CORTEX_STEP_TYPE_USER_INPUT
  status: CORTEX_STEP_STATUS_DONE
  metadata {
